{"categories":[],"data_as_of":"2026-11-12T00:00:00Z","description":"本站近 30 天收录的 生成式 AI 相关证据与变化。","evidence":[{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_41d3f459fdf663c57644e0e2751ead5861c390fbdd58b9793d32be7cc3125a0a","internal_url":"/posts/20261112-blogs_podcasts-the-attendees-guide-to-the-aws-reinvent-2026-aiml--0-e3fb265c4a/","observation_id":"obs_e3fb265c4a7f0c03e332381c674e35ece02aac3c1eec6df11ee65ed9b8e8bec6","published_at":"2026-11-11T21:05:59Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一份面向 AWS re:Invent 2026 AI/ML 专题的参会指南，介绍不同会话形式，并按 AI 芯片、模型训练与推理、智能体开发及管理等层级整理相关学习内容。内容还梳理了 AWS 从基础设施到智能体解决方案的 AI 技术栈。","title":"The attendee’s guide to the AWS re:Invent 2026 AI/ML track"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_bc15a0787a1dbcaf6550bdacd92eb21eb5aa279a241eb77c340680648b80fcb9","internal_url":"/posts/20261111-arxiv-kolmogorov-chapman-maps-trajectory-free-learning-f-0-5c36d448a8/","observation_id":"obs_5c36d448a8b8e4f59135987bae77e299b85b0879d181d61b7e7c9246ac156721","published_at":"2026-11-09T18:59:13Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"KC-Maps 是一种无需完整模拟轨迹的随机微分方程学习方法，仅利用边缘分布样本及已知的漂移、扩散系数，训练神经网络直接预测任意时刻的状态分布。","title":"Kolmogorov-Chapman Maps: Trajectory-Free Learning for Simulating Molecular Dynamics"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_27d7cfc3822ac623dd4a5f8737112573d31ab225a894bcf630b7e6d4e83477ba","internal_url":"/posts/20261107-blogs_podcasts-sagemaker-inference-now-supports-multi-instance-gp-0-819549b983/","observation_id":"obs_819549b983fd9118af23e6dd5e48bbf3e95ea8e30cf14630f24b1b5f1369fa27","published_at":"2026-11-06T18:01:00Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"Amazon SageMaker Inference 现支持使用 NVIDIA Multi-Instance GPU（MIG）将一块物理 GPU 划分为多个独立分区，让不同模型共享同一块 GPU，同时获得硬件层面的资源隔离和更合适的算力规格。","title":"SageMaker Inference now supports Multi-Instance GPU to maximize GPU utilization for model endpoints"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_0d40